message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software (this record) and the associated Application Note."
title: "spheroidkit: a transparent, no-training open-source tool for end-to-end measurement of tumour spheroids"
abstract: >-
  spheroidkit is an open-source Python toolkit for end-to-end analysis of tumour
  spheroid (MCTS) brightfield microscopy images: illumination correction,
  texture-based segmentation, shape-aware size measurement, growth tracking,
  dose-response (IC50) fitting, group statistics and a morphological viability
  surrogate. It uses transparent classical image processing (no training data,
  no GPU) and is packaged as an installable Python library.
type: software
